OL,3,GNEWSAMonth-long survey to assess Isle
OL,4,Aof Man's roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA month-long survey of the Isle of
OL,7,FMan's roads has got under way.
OL,9,FThe project is being carried out by
OL,10,Fspecialist highways surveying company
OL,11,FXAIS ` PTS across the island's roads
OL,12,Fnetwork.
OL,14,FThe firm is using vehicle-mounted
OL,15,Fsensors to capture the conditions of
OL,16,Froad surfaces while travelling at usual
OL,17,Fspeed.
